\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Cross-task evidence-condition diagnostic. Homogeneous route reuse produces localized exposure and would be a false certification if accepted as a global stop in all four tasks. Broader source-route exposure improves completion eligibility. The \texttt  {urllib3} row is the boundary case: route-partitioned exposure is broad but still incomplete, so the controller outputs \textsc  {Continue}{} rather than \textsc  {Safe}{}.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
